{
  "description": "Request rules every helper shares, decided by the shared core (ADR-DESK-054): a focused field read's bound (1 to 20,000 UTF-16 units) and its reply (null when longer or when a break the core added (U+2029, a rich editor's block break) could split a secret, else redacted, with those breaks as line breaks), and a paste's text (not empty, at most 512 KiB, no NUL) and deadline (later than now, at most 5 s ahead). Each helper's suite runs every case through the C ABI it ships with; `refused: true` cases are refused.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "a field bound at the most a request may ask",
      "request": {
        "field": {
          "maxLength": 20000
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "maxLength": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a field bound of one unit",
      "request": {
        "field": {
          "maxLength": 1
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "maxLength": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "no text read from the field",
      "request": {
        "field": {
          "maxLength": 20000,
          "text": null
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "value": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a field's text, its secret-looking part taken out",
      "request": {
        "field": {
          "maxLength": 20000,
          "text": "Draft reply. password: hunter2x"
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "value": "Draft reply. password: [redacted]"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a rich editor's text, the breaks the core added (U+2029) given as line breaks",
      "request": {
        "field": {
          "maxLength": 20000,
          "text": "Hi All,\u2029Why does it move?\u2029\n--"
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "value": "Hi All,\nWhy does it move?\n\n--"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a rich editor's text with a key split by a break the core added, withheld",
      "request": {
        "field": {
          "maxLength": 20000,
          "text": "Public words.\u2029sk-Review\u2029Fixture1234567890"
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "value": null
      }
    },
